        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana SDL688 Screen Door  Mortise Lockset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis decorative all brass construction mortise lockset for screen doors, patio doors, and storm doors. It has a door lever and thumb turn deadbolt lock on the inside, and a door knob on the outside. Mortise latches are very durable making them the best choice for heavier storm doors without sacrificing style. The deadbolt lock has 1/2\" throw.  Adjustable for 1\" to  2\" thick doors. This decorative latch set is available in 9 finish choices to match your decor. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/low-profile-residential-door-closer-global-tc901\"><b>Low Profile Door Closer</b></a>, perfect for even heavy storm doors. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana SDL688 Screen Door Mortise Locks:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Case Depth: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Case Height: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Faceplate Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Faceplate Height: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Escutcheon Plate Width: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Escutcheon Plate Height: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1\" -  2\" Thick Doors</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Knob Projection: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Lever Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt: 1/2\" Throw</li>\r\n<li>Reversible Handling</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/SDL688.pdf?v=1691095375\" target =\"new\"><b>Deltana SDL688 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Decorative Screen Door Mortise Lock Set | Deltana SDL688",
                "description": "Deltana SDL688 Screen Door Latch Mortise Lockset.  Solid Brass construction mortise lockset for screen doors, patio doors and storm doors. Has a door lever and thumb turn lock on the inside and a door knob outside. Available in 9 different high quality finish colors.",
